        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86721, Keaton Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keaton Door Handle is available in 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. A modern front door pull, it is available in all the hottest finish colors including satin brass, black, and satin nickel. This Keaton Door Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware needed to install it on a wood, metal, or composite doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/keaton-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86721\"><b>Keaton Pulls with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Keaton Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86721-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262383\"><b>Emtek Keaton Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86721:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86722:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
